      Data: 54|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: Exponent controlling how sharply lowpass cutoff drops as clarity decreases.
        1 = linear fade (audible at any range). 2 = quadratic (subtle at close range,
        sharp drop near max range). 3+ = very sharp drop, audio stays clear until
        nearly out of range.
